                                                            <div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-1510" class="elementor-element elementor-element-bef1e65 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="bef1e65" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
                                                                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6210a5c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6210a5c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
                                                                    <p>We work in four clear phases: Deep Discovery (kick-off, brief, mood board), Creative Concept (script, storyboard, styleframes), Full Production (design, animation, sound), and Final Delivery
                                                                        (all formats, all platforms). Each phase ends with your approval before we move forward — so there are no surprises and nothing gets built without your sign-off.</p>
                                                                </div>
