                                                                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8e19211 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8e19211" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
                                                                    <p>You&#8217;ll have a dedicated project lead who is your single point of contact from kick-off to delivery. They coordinate the internal team — animators, designers, and sound designers
                                                                        — so you never have to chase multiple people. For larger productions, a creative director also joins key review sessions.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9cee0a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="9cee0a0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
