                                                                    <p>Delays on our end are rare — but if they happen, we communicate early and adjust at no extra cost. Delays caused by late client feedback or scope changes may push the timeline accordingly.
                                                                        We build buffer time into every project plan and flag risks early so neither side is caught off guard at the deadline.</p>
