                                                                    <p>That&#8217;s completely fine — and actually common. Most of our best projects started with nothing more than a vague idea or a business problem. Our Creative Concept phase exists exactly
                                                                        for this. We work with you to develop the script, narrative, and visual direction from scratch. You bring the goal; we bring the creative engine.</p>
